## 1. Executive Summary

NutriSmart is an AI-powered web application that empowers individuals to make better food choices and build sustainable healthy eating habits. By leveraging Google Gemini 2.0, real-time search grounding, voice interaction, and contextual location data, NutriSmart acts as a personal nutritionist available 24/7.

**Core Problem**: 72% of people know they should eat healthier but lack real-time, personalized, contextual guidance at the moment of food decision.

**Core Solution**: An AI companion that understands context (where you are, what you can cook, what you like) and gives actionable, voice-enabled food guidance in real time.

